{"seq":3,"slug":"embedded-patterns","title":"嵌入模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/deployment/embedded-patterns","wordCount":820,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"嵌入模式\">嵌入模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把 SQLite 嵌入桌面与移动应用时，除了数据库本身，还要处理一系列工程问题：数据库文件放在哪里（用户数据目录 vs 应用目录）、如何支持多进程访问（文件锁与并发模型）、以及原生模块如何随应用打包分发。这些&quot;应用外壳&quot;层面的模式，决定了嵌入式 SQLite 在真实产品中的稳定性。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"桌面应用中的-sqlite\">桌面应用中的 SQLite</h2><p>SQLite 在 <strong>Electron</strong> 和 <strong>Tauri</strong> 等桌面应用框架中是最常见的本地数据存储方案。嵌入式部署需要处理数据库文件位置、进程模型和原生模块打包等特有问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Electron&#10;        MAIN[主进程&lt;br/&gt;Node.js] --&gt; SQLITE1[better-sqlite3]&#10;        RENDERER[渲染进程&lt;br/&gt;Chromium] --&gt;|IPC| MAIN&#10;        SQLITE1 --&gt; DB1[(用户数据目录&lt;br/&gt;SQLite 文件)]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Tauri&#10;        FRONT[前端&lt;br/&gt;WebView] --&gt;|Tauri 命令| RUST[Rust 后端]&#10;        RUST --&gt; SQLITE2[rusqlite]&#10;        SQLITE2 --&gt; DB2[(应用数据目录&lt;br/&gt;SQLite 文件)]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph Electron\n        MAIN[主进程&lt;br/&gt;Node.js] --&gt; SQLITE1[better-sqlite3]\n        RENDERER[渲染进程&lt;br/&gt;Chromium] --&gt;|IPC| MAIN\n        SQLITE1 --&gt; DB1[(用户数据目录&lt;br/&gt;SQLite 文件)]\n    end\n    subgraph Tauri\n        FRONT[前端&lt;br/&gt;WebView] --&gt;|Tauri 命令| RUST[Rust 后端]\n        RUST --&gt; SQLITE2[rusqlite]\n        SQLITE2 --&gt; DB2[(应用数据目录&lt;br/&gt;SQLite 文件)]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>SQLite 驱动</th>\n<th>进程模型</th>\n<th>打包方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Electron</td>\n<td>better-sqlite3</td>\n<td>主进程运行</td>\n<td>electron-rebuild</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tauri</td>\n<td>tauri-plugin-sql</td>\n<td>Rust 后端运行</td>\n<td>编译时链接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"数据库文件位置\">数据库文件位置</h2><p>选择正确的数据库文件存储位置至关重要：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { app } from &#39;electron&#39;;&#10;import { join } from &#39;node:path&#39;;&#10;import Database from &#39;better-sqlite3&#39;;&#10;&#10;const userDataPath = app.getPath(&#39;userData&#39;);&#10;const dbPath = join(userDataPath, &#39;data.db&#39;);&#10;&#10;const db = new Database(dbPath);&#10;db.pragma(&#39;journal_mode = WAL&#39;);&#10;db.pragma(&#39;synchronous = NORMAL&#39;);&#10;db.pragma(&#39;foreign_keys = ON&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { app } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'electron'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { join } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:path'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Database </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'better-sqlite3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> userDataPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'userData'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dbPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userDataPath, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'data.db'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dbPath);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'journal_mode = WAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'synchronous = NORMAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'foreign_keys = ON'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>推荐路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>macOS</td>\n<td>~/Library/Application Support/&lt;app-name&gt;/</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Windows</td>\n<td>%APPDATA%/&lt;app-name&gt;/</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linux</td>\n<td>~/.config/&lt;app-name&gt;/</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iOS</td>\n<td>Documents/ 或 Library/Application Support/</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android</td>\n<td>/data/data/&lt;package&gt;/databases/</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 永远不要将数据库文件放在应用安装目录中。安装目录可能是只读的（macOS App Sandbox），且更新应用时可能被覆盖。使用操作系统指定的用户数据目录。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"多进程访问\">多进程访问</h2><p>桌面应用中可能出现多个进程同时访问同一个数据库文件的情况：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 多进程场景&#10;        MAIN_P[主进程] --&gt; DB[(数据库文件)]&#10;        WORKER1[Worker 进程 1] --&gt; DB&#10;        WORKER2[Worker 进程 2] --&gt; DB&#10;    end&#10;    DB --&gt; LOCK[文件锁机制]\">graph TD\n    subgraph 多进程场景\n        MAIN_P[主进程] --&gt; DB[(数据库文件)]\n        WORKER1[Worker 进程 1] --&gt; DB\n        WORKER2[Worker 进程 2] --&gt; DB\n    end\n    DB --&gt; LOCK[文件锁机制]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import Database from &#39;better-sqlite3&#39;;&#10;&#10;function createSafeConnection(dbPath: string): Database.Database {&#10;  const db = new Database(dbPath);&#10;&#10;  db.pragma(&#39;journal_mode = WAL&#39;);&#10;  db.pragma(&#39;busy_timeout = 10000&#39;);&#10;  db.pragma(&#39;synchronous = NORMAL&#39;);&#10;  db.pragma(&#39;foreign_keys = ON&#39;);&#10;&#10;  return db;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Database </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'better-sqlite3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createSafeConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dbPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dbPath);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'journal_mode = WAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'busy_timeout = 10000'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'synchronous = NORMAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'foreign_keys = ON'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>并发场景</th>\n<th>WAL 模式行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多进程同时读</td>\n<td>正常工作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一个进程写，其他读</td>\n<td>正常工作（读写并发）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多个进程同时写</td>\n<td>串行化（busy_timeout 等待）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进程崩溃后其他进程访问</td>\n<td>SQLite 自动恢复</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"文件锁\">文件锁</h2><p>SQLite 使用操作系统的文件锁（<code>fcntl</code> on POSIX, <code>LockFileEx</code> on Windows）来协调并发访问。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 锁级别&#10;        UNLOCKED[UNLOCKED&lt;br/&gt;无锁]&#10;        SHARED[SHARED&lt;br/&gt;共享锁]&#10;        RESERVED[RESERVED&lt;br/&gt;保留锁]&#10;        PENDING[PENDING&lt;br/&gt;待定锁]&#10;        EXCLUSIVE[EXCLUSIVE&lt;br/&gt;排他锁]&#10;    end&#10;    UNLOCKED --&gt; SHARED&#10;    SHARED --&gt; RESERVED&#10;    RESERVED --&gt; PENDING&#10;    PENDING --&gt; EXCLUSIVE\">graph LR\n    subgraph 锁级别\n        UNLOCKED[UNLOCKED&lt;br/&gt;无锁]\n        SHARED[SHARED&lt;br/&gt;共享锁]\n        RESERVED[RESERVED&lt;br/&gt;保留锁]\n        PENDING[PENDING&lt;br/&gt;待定锁]\n        EXCLUSIVE[EXCLUSIVE&lt;br/&gt;排他锁]\n    end\n    UNLOCKED --&gt; SHARED\n    SHARED --&gt; RESERVED\n    RESERVED --&gt; PENDING\n    PENDING --&gt; EXCLUSIVE</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>锁类型</th>\n<th>可共存的锁</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SHARED</td>\n<td>SHARED, RESERVED</td>\n<td>读取数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RESERVED</td>\n<td>SHARED</td>\n<td>准备写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PENDING</td>\n<td>现有 SHARED</td>\n<td>等待写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXCLUSIVE</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>实际写入磁盘</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function withRetry&lt;T&gt;(fn: () =&gt; T, maxRetries: number = 3, delayMs: number = 100): T {&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; maxRetries; i++) {&#10;    try {&#10;      return fn();&#10;    } catch (err: unknown) {&#10;      const error = err as Error;&#10;      if (error.message.includes(&#39;SQLITE_BUSY&#39;) &amp;&amp; i &lt; maxRetries - 1) {&#10;        const jitter = Math.random() * delayMs;&#10;        Atomics.wait(new Int32Array(new SharedArrayBuffer(4)), 0, 0, delayMs + jitter);&#10;        continue;&#10;      }&#10;      throw err;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  throw new Error(&#39;重试次数已用尽&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> withRetry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\